  "bodyHash": "A0fjBc56d7g=",
  "content": "<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">更好的树叶（Better Leaves）为树叶方块添加了额外的层次，使它们看起来更茂密、更自然。</span></p>\n <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ff62e782ee2fbe5fec71a7c14ac5f38a4f350f07.png\" alt=\"一个展示树叶方块的横幅，上面写着 '更好的树叶性能更新'\" />\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">9.0 版本专注于性能提升，纹理会自动为每一片树叶生成。与 8.1 版本不同，这不是动态的，因此你需要遵循几个简单步骤，为配合纹理包使用而编译自定义版本。</span></p>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/RL_--nShJ9w\" title=\"YouTube 视频播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在 8.1 及更低版本中，此资源包不添加任何纹理，因此几乎可以兼容所有资源包和模组（纹理会动态调整）。不过，这会牺牲性能。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>我强烈建议你同时安装 <a href=\"https://www.modrinth.com/mod/cull-leaves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cull Leaves</a> 模组以及 Sodium/Embeddium，以获得更高的 FPS。</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>喜欢这个资源包？来看看我的另一个资源包：</strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/round-trees\"><strong>圆形树木（Round Trees）</strong></a><strong>。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a title=\"圆形树木项目页面\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/round-trees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f4eb3536092ffc67ba61236a96a7115a44f65098.png\" alt=\"一个圆形树木原木，旁边写着\"圆形树木\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"91\"></span></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/893/699/betterleavesbop.jpg\" width=\"842\" height=\"219\" /></p>\n</center>\n\n<details>\n<summary>明确支持的模组（v9.5）：</summary>\n\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ad-astra\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ad Astra</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/alexs-caves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Caves</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/architects-palette\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architect's Palette</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elemental\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ars Elemental</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ars-nouveau\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ars Nouveau</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/aurorasdecorations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aurora's Decorations</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/betterend\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better End</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/betternether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Nether</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bewitchment\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bewitchment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/biome-makeover\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biome Makeover</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/blockus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blockus</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/blossom\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blossom</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blue Skies</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bountiful-fares\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bountiful Fares</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/chipped\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Chipped</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cobblemon\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/mod/croptopia\" rel=\"nofollow\">Croptopia</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/deep-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deep Aether</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/deeperdarker\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deeper and Darker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dreamwoods\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dreamwoods</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.