><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/paradise-lost\" rel=\"nofollow\">Paradise Lost</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/regions-unexplored\" rel=\"nofollow\">Regions Unexplored</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/tech-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tech Reborn</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/terrestria\" rel=\"nofollow\">Terrestria</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Twilight Forest</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Undergarden</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/traverse\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traverse</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/the-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/the-aether-redux\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether: Redux</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/wilder-wild\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wilder Wild</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/windswept\" rel=\"nofollow\">Windswept</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>明确支持的模组（v8.1）：</summary>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Ad Astra, Architect's Pallete, Ars Nouveau, Aurora's Decorations, Croptopia, BetterDefaultBiomes, BetterNether, BetterEnd, BetterEndForge, Bewitchment, Biome Makeover, Biomes O' Plenty, Bloomful, Bountiful Fares, Cobblemon, Colorful Azaleas, Crimson, Druidcraft, Dynamic Trees, Ecologics, Environmental, Fruits Delight, Good Ending, Integrated Dynamics, JavaDungeons, Luminiferous Uplands, Mubble, Natures Spirit, Oh The Biomes You'll Go, Quark, Quek's End, Regions Unexplored, Swamp Expansion, Tech Reborn, Terrestria, Traverse, UpgradeAquatic, Wild Explorer, Woods and Mires</span>\n</details>",
